# Lets Find Out. The effect starts on the press. The place lands on the next bar.
# Seed 42, reboot at 0 ms: the private roll's first place is the air, vinyl,
# and the kick was the silent drum, so the next press brings the kick in.
# Back returns the intro. Sleep, dialled, steps from the groove into the chord room.
seed 42
reboot
wait 200
expect iammask 65
expect par10 1
expect par20 2
expect par6 35
expect par4 0
peakreset
tap LFO
expect litbtn 1032
wait 1600
expect iammask 0x49
expect par20 6
expect par4 52
expect par10 1
expect par6 35
expect par92 3
expect iamsec 0
expect litbtn 1024
expect peak_db_max -0.5
tap OCT-
wait 1600
expect iammask 65
expect par10 1
expect par20 2
expect par21 14
expect par4 0
expect par6 35
expect iamsec 0
tap LFO
wait 1600
expect iammask 0x51
expect par20 2
expect par10 1
expect par4 0
expect iamsec 0
tap OCT-
wait 1600
expect iammask 65

# Sleep is a room, not a beat loop. The groove's next room is the chord.
seed 42
reboot
wait 200
spin PRESET 12
wait 1600
expect iamstyle 12
expect iamsec 1
expect iammask 0x4E
tap LFO
expect litbtn 1032
wait 5200
expect iamstyle 12
expect iamsec 2
expect iammask 0x4B
expect litbtn 1040
